# Realm roles every realm must carry, and the machine identity that holds each.
# A realm file only seeds a FRESH realm (--import-realm skips existing ones), so
# a role a new component needs reaches running realms here: ops/keycloak/converge.sh
# creates the role where it is missing and grants it to the named client's service
# account where that account exists. One role per line: <role> [<client-id>].
# A role with no client is defined for people (staff composites) to be given later.
benefit:read
benefit:write bss-ordering
